      "problem": "Let $B=\\{{b}_{1},{b}_{2},{b}_{3}\\}$ be a basis of ${R}^{3}$ and let $T:{R}^{3}\\to {R}^{3}$ be a linear transformation. Find $[T(x)]_{B},$ given that\n$\\,$ $[T]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$",
